Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 18:42:01 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 11/24] sherlock-lfr: E3 J3 and J4, the L_iface fixture and the
 full tape

Example iface_fixture: the bench L plus the 4 interface AIRs (43 AIRs,
12,164 public words) at the OD-19 L set, one key, proofs for the full-V,
full-P, overflow and missing-R cases. Test j5_gate: j4 runs the tape of
every case (same shape, same tape, R check, 1,522 exposed words); the
statements decode equal to the native ones and missing-R is refused;
j5 proves at the L_Fr set with D3 at the measured key.
